AssigneesColumn = Assignees column
AssigneesColumnHelp = Each person of this column is added to the opportunity as "Sales representative assigned to the project". A person is recognized by ID, login, email, full name, first name alone or first name followed by the initial of the last name. Separate several people with a comma, "/", "&" or "and".
